  "cohort": "Complete endpoints only; over all training arms each lane receives 20480 actual moves. Reported lifetimes use own placements after any library warm start. Live lanes are right-censored. End-containing states are counted from lane birth or rollout start, whichever is later, through the final actual placement; episode_end update IDs and occupancy are independently checked against all update and summary receipts. The actor also receives TD information on every nonterminal transition.",
  "testable_next": "In a separate matched ablation collect identical 32x512 fixed-policy data per batch for both arms. Compare full GAE propagation across the midpoint with a single forced GAE cut at 256 that retains its bootstrap. Hold lambda, reward, critic, seeds, optimizer cadence/work and two updates per collected batch identical across arms. The extra 256 steps of temporal support are the only target-construction difference. Quantify terminal-exposed state fraction, MC value error on uncensored disjoint labels separately from censor violations, fresh paired greedy survival and elapsed throughput. Both arms use the same collection cadence, which differs from the existing trainer. Existing observations do not select a winning horizon.",
  "source_hashes_verified_against_protocol": true,
